{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788059503857052802,"compiled_state":{"alias":"parallel-amused-taruca","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"a3fbe9cba3e0a797635d9a418cd84df1eff1cb15bc498b75461d7eaad38310ab","event_uuid":"c967970d-f6e9-4fba-a406-a7321ae87df4","position":{"commit_sha":"e9dccaf3621c09205dee26744fa2657c04e3cb19","position":"1788059486963673173-c967970d-f6e9-4fba-a406-a7321ae87df4"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"2c3d64d6555f1ee38e586dcfc4588e6d1aa3a898346916cfd705553c1d72db1a","event_uuid":"2b0e6406-aed8-44f7-b46a-1659c75809ba","position":{"commit_sha":"862dcf5296a371322878bb9fd4a4fad3924cc10d","position":"1788059503857052801-2b0e6406-aed8-44f7-b46a-1659c75809ba"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788059486963673173,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"2b0e6406-aed8-44f7-b46a-1659c75809ba","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"9097-2741-6462-424c"}],"description":"## Prevention remediation for incident 1c0d (operational/architecture lane)\n\nPost-mortem: `9097-2741-6462-424c`. Defense-in-depth against the *trigger* (not the failure mode): many agent sessions ran frontier/opus `review-plan` concurrently on ONE shared Bedrock account, self-inflicting account-level throttling.\n\n### Candidate\nA client-side concurrency limiter / rate-limit / shared budget on frontier gate ops so many-agent fan-out cannot drive the shared account into throttling.\n\n### Open decision (ARCHITECTURE — escalate, likely ADR)\nThis is a design decision, not a mechanical fix. Needs a go/no-go on: whether to add a shared-account budget at all (the 1c0d fix already makes throttling degrade gracefully to retryable, so this is defense-in-depth, not correctness); where the limiter lives (per-host, per-account, MCP-server-mediated); and how it interacts with the existing retry/backoff. Likely warrants an ADR. Do NOT implement until the go/no-go + design are recorded.\n\n### Note\nDistinct from the other three prevention tickets: those add **detection** (would have caught the latent defect); this reduces the **trigger frequency**. Lower priority now that throttling degrades to retryable.\n\n### Acceptance criteria (pending decision)\n- [ ] Go/no-go recorded; if go, ADR drafted (limiter scope, placement, interaction with retry/backoff).","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["prevention","incident-1c0d","llm","operational","architecture","needs-decision"],"ticket_id":"254e-1770-854b-47a2","ticket_type":"task","title":"Prevention (operational): concurrency budget / rate-limit for shared-account frontier gate ops","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["c967970d-f6e9-4fba-a406-a7321ae87df4","2b0e6406-aed8-44f7-b46a-1659c75809ba"]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788059503857052802,"uuid":"8dbc2add-6d6a-4800-9916-816ab73f5603"}